## Strengths
The paper studies an important problem and provides novel results. The main result (Theorem 2) is especially interesting, as it gives a precise characterization of the optimal fitting ratio $\mathcal{R}^*_{tr/te}$ in terms of $\alpha$ and $\beta$, the exponents of the power-law eigenstructure.

## Weaknesses
The paper is not always clear and well-written, and some of the notation is confusing. For example:
